/v/t64.5771-25/39031545_1695566271189918_7563581897204183653_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7jLj35VXoEQ7kNvwF2sEfw&_nc_oc=AdnrxzbvF_zL0w5D45u0gggufmVfyRLakBlPzzntaVnlgjpgtgaK5Zdw-iuawrIXoa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvV-_i2FkLurVj-KGtArOtP5kBj5B47egMqgManBxZD5Q&oe=699EDABC"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "3751167238508534", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_3751167241841867_2951941851866511973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hLUa_JLWBDEQ7kNvwG5Qo2n&_nc_oc=AdldZe_V-pfmvYYosCJ6CJssQuUajjiHC8w-0TEOKxT9H5HKvtXh_gFQoF4LJNmqQVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvKrmLm7b6xEpFi3MMUXgTy1R-AELvUZPgwjawsQKYthA&oe=699EE35D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1691892224915749", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580056_1691892228249082_8993988736869608245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqRUHvxjvaAQ7kNvwEN5oyN&_nc_oc=AdnKK-QsEEs3cFgxh7y4SqqB2dVJUR0HOMcBFJfhLhZzOuDzaLBpqsaL9sqLgdznoT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvBsPvxq6Ez6vjcelmnFI5Y12dYk-cZGUfUlfSwzfTG_Q&oe=699EE4DA"}, "display_name": "Stealthy Swipers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience.\n\nGame Features:\n\n    Immersive VR Environment:\n        Experience a meticulously crafted, enormous space brought to life with state-of-the-art VR graphics. The game environment is designed to be visually stunning and deeply immersive, making you feel like you are truly inside a high-tech, futuristic world.\n\n    